<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/glue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[GLobal Unique Enterprise (GLUE) Identifiers](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-spice-glue-id/), as defined by the IETF Internet-Draft, is expressed as a GLUE URI, a Uniform Resource Identifier that standardizes the representation of existing organizational entity identifiers."@en .
